%%label III. Scherzo: Lebhaft – Trio
%%note F minor. A scherzo in broken chords with hammered cross-rhythms over a held C; the Trio in D flat is a calm song for flute and clarinet.
X:1
T:Schumann’s Missing Symphony
T:III. Scherzo: Lebhaft – Trio
C:Claude (AI), in the manner of Robert Schumann
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:"Lebhaft" 1/4=184
%%score [fl ob cl bn] [hn tpt tbn] timp [v1 v2 va vc cb]
% Original AI-composed homage. The score is written at sounding pitch.
V:fl clef=treble name="Fl. I, II"
V:ob clef=treble name="Ob. I, II"
V:cl clef=treble name="Cl. I, II"
V:bn clef=bass name="Bn. I, II"
